    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n99740" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">συνδια-φέρω</span></b> , <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>bear along with one</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἄνεμος ς. τὴν ναῦν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Luc.
					<u>Hist.Conscr.</u>
					45
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>bear to the end along with, help in maintaining</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">οἱ Μιλήσιοι τοῖσι Χίοισι τὸν . .
					πόλεμον συνδιήνεικαν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Hdt.
					1.18
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				5.79
			</span></i>,<i><span class="en">
				99
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ξυνδιήνεγκαν μεθ᾽ ἡμῶν ἐσβολάς τε καὶ
					μάχας</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Ar.
					<u>Eq.</u>
					597
				</span></i>
			 (troch.); 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ς. πάθος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Plu.
					<u>Brut.</u>
					13
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Jul.
				<u>Or.</u>
				8.241c
			</span></i>:—
				Med.
			, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὰ τοῦ πολέμου</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Ph.
					1.323
				</span></i>
			.</div>
